  "recipe": "Flat blue plate (corner spread <= 10, separation >= 80): blue-minus-max(red, green) unmix with the measured guard band, edge-only despill, alpha>=8 regions kept when they hold an alpha>=128 pixel; then the 2 px edge band re-solved by tools/rematte_blue_plate.py clean_edges. Geometry unchanged. A green plate swaps green and blue before these rules and back after them, and its edge band also re-solves pixels whose green over max(red, blue) exceeds edge_spill_threshold (guide p99.9 + 6), keeping re-solved green at most that far above max(red, blue), translucent pixels no higher than it. A frame whose alpha 8-199 band exceeds max(0.5, 3 x the take median) of its alpha>=200 area is rejected as a plate pulse."
